+/**
+ * TODO(eroman): get rid of this, as it is only used by 1 callsite.
+ *
+ * Indent |lines| by |start|.
+ *
+ * For example, if |start| = ' -> ' and |lines| = ['line1', 'line2', 'line3']
+ * the output will be:
+ *
+ *   " -> line1\n" +
+ *   "    line2\n" +
+ *   "    line3"
